        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>鹅口疮、胃溃疡与小儿腹泻脱水对比表</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #efeae2;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f5f1ea;\n    padding: 8px 26px 24px 26px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .top-strip {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #7a7168;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #cfc7bc;\n    padding-bottom: 3px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  h2.sec {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 16px 0 10px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  h3.cap {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    background: #fbf8f3;\n  }\n  th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #6a6a6a;\n    padding: 5px 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n  th {\n    background: #f0ebe3;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  td.head {\n    background: #f0ebe3;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .bold { font-weight: bold; }\n  p.note {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin: 6px 0 0 0;\n    text-indent: 1em;\n  }\n  .faded {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #b9ada0;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .divider-space { height: 10px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"top-strip\">[illegible]要点</div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"sec\">14. 鹅口疮与外阴阴道假丝酵母菌病</h2>\n  <h3 class=\"cap\">鹅口疮与外阴阴道假丝酵母菌病异同点</h3>\n\n  <table>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"width:22%;\">疾病</th>\n      <th style=\"width:39%;\">鹅口疮</th>\n      <th style=\"width:39%;\">外阴阴道假丝酵母菌病</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">致病菌</td>\n      <td rowspan=\"1\">白色念珠菌</td>\n      <td>外阴阴道假丝酵母菌病</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">临床表现</td>\n      <td>口腔黏膜白色乳凝块</td>\n      <td>白色念珠菌</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">治疗</td>\n      <td>2% 碳酸氢钠</td>\n      <td>白带呈豆渣样</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n      <td>2%～4% 碳酸氢钠</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <p class=\"note\">注：白色念珠菌属于真菌，又名白假丝酵母菌</p>\n\n  <h2 class=\"sec\">15. 胃溃疡和十二指肠溃疡</h2>\n  <h3 class=\"cap\">胃溃疡和十二指肠溃疡的特点</h3>\n\n  <table>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"width:20%;\"></th>\n      <th style=\"width:36%;\">胃溃疡（GU）</th>\n      <th style=\"width:44%;\">十二指肠溃疡（DU）</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">病变部位</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">胃角和胃窦小弯</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">球部前壁</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">发病机制</td>\n      <td>主要是保护因素减弱</td>\n      <td>主要是侵袭因素增强</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">疼痛部位</td>\n      <td>剑突下正中或偏左</td>\n      <td>上腹正中或偏右</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">疼痛性质</td>\n      <td>烧灼感或痉挛感</td>\n      <td>饥饿感或烧灼感</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">疼痛时间</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">餐后痛即进食后 0.5～1<br>小时出现，至下餐前消失</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">空腹痛即进食后 2～3 小时出现，<br>下次进餐后缓解，可有夜间痛</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">疼痛节律</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">进食-疼痛-缓解</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">疼痛-进食-缓解</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"faded\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"sec\">16. 小儿腹泻脱水临床表现</h2>\n  <h3 class=\"cap\">不同程度脱水的临床表现</h3>\n\n  <table>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"width:22%;\">脱水程度</th>\n      <th style=\"width:24%;\">轻度</th>\n      <th style=\"width:28%;\">中度</th>\n      <th style=\"width:26%;\">重度</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">体重减少</td>\n      <td>&lt;5%</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">5%～10%</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">&gt;10%</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">皮肤、黏膜</td>\n      <td>弹性可、稍干燥</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">弹性差、干燥</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">弹性极差、极干燥</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">眼窝、前囟</td>\n      <td>稍凹陷</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">明显凹陷</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">深度凹陷</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">尿量</td>\n      <td>略少</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">明显减少</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">少尿／无尿</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">末梢循环</td>\n      <td>正常</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">四肢稍凉</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">四肢厥冷</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"head\">精神状态</td>\n      <td>稍差</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">烦躁／萎靡</td>\n      <td class=\"bold\">昏睡／昏迷</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <p class=\"note\">注：轻度往往描述为稍或略，重度往往描述为极或无</p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
